==English==
===Etymology===
from the phrase "[[trojan horse]]".

===Noun===
'''trojan'''
# {{computing}} [[software|Software]] that appears to perform or actually performs a desired task for a user while performing a harmful task without the user's knowledge or consent.

===Citation===
"A long war, not with cranes, but with weeds, those Trojans who had sun and rain and dews on their side." (Henry David Thoreau, Walden, ''The beanfield'')
